10 REM RUNTIME ERRORS ON PURPOSE: EACH ONE STOPS THE PROGRAM
20 PRINT "1 /0  2 BS  3 RG  4 OD  5 TM  6 FC  7 OV  8 DD  9 NF  10 OM"
30 INPUT "WHICH ERROR"; W
40 ON W GOTO 100, 200, 300, 400, 500, 600, 700, 800, 900, 1000
50 PRINT "THAT ONE IS NOT ON THE LIST"
60 END
100 REM DIVISION BY ZERO
110 X = 0
120 PRINT "1 / X IS "; 1 / X
200 REM SUBSCRIPT OUT OF RANGE
210 DIM A(10)
220 PRINT A(11)
300 REM RETURN WITHOUT GOSUB
310 RETURN
400 REM OUT OF DATA: THERE IS ONLY ONE ITEM
410 READ A$, B$
500 REM TYPE MISMATCH: READ NEVER TURNS A STRING INTO A NUMBER
510 READ N
600 REM ILLEGAL FUNCTION CALL
610 PRINT SQR(-1)
700 REM OVERFLOW: A % VARIABLE HOLDS WHOLE NUMBERS UP TO 2^53 - 1
710 N% = 1E16
800 REM REDIMENSIONED ARRAY
810 DIM D(3)
820 DIM D(3)
900 REM NEXT WITHOUT FOR: THE SUBROUTINE JUMPS TO NEXT INSTEAD OF RETURNING
910 FOR I = 1 TO 2
920   GOSUB 940
930   GOTO 950
940   GOTO 950
950 NEXT I
1000 REM OUT OF MEMORY: GOSUB CALLS ITSELF UNTIL IT IS 1,001 LEVELS DEEP
1010 GOSUB 1010
1020 DATA HELLO
